  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Dowsing Rod"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "The "
        },
        {
          "text": "Dowsing Rod",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " is a very useful tool for novice and experienced wizards alike.  It is capable of finding several different kinds of things depending on what the user has in their other hand.\n\nWith "
        },
        {
          "text": "nothing ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "in the other hand, the dowsing rod will orient the user "
        },
        {
          "text": "towards their bed",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nWith a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Rune of Marking",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the other hand, the dowsing rod will orient the user "
        },
        {
          "text": "towards the marked position",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nWith a"
        },
        {
          "text": " Player Charm",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the other hand, the dowsing rod will orient the user "
        },
        {
          "text": "towards the attuned player's position",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nWith a"
        },
        {
          "text": " Chimerite Gem",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the other hand, the dowsing rod will orient the user "
        },
        {
          "text": "towards the nearest wellspring",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
